==Trivia==
*Using an item on a cow prompts the message "The cow doesn't want that." as opposed to the usual "Nothing interesting happens."
* The Zanaris cow variant had a festive override wearing a [[Santa hat]] and Rudolph nose during the [[2016 Christmas event/Gallery|2016]] Christmas event.
* The Isle of Souls cow variant’s examine text references the quote “A rose by any other name would smell as sweet” from Romeo and Juliet by William Shakespeare.

